flowchart LR
  accTitle: Proposed B6 cross-stage control loop
  accDescr: A proposed engineering architecture links a consequential proposal to a versioned uncertainty estimate. That lineage is consumed at memory admission, planning, scheduling, tool authorization, execution monitoring, and stopping. New observations create linked revisions rather than silently replacing prior estimates.
  P[Consequential proposal] --> U[Versioned uncertainty lineage]
  U --> M[Memory admission]
  M --> PL[Planning]
  PL --> S[Resource scheduler]
  S --> A[Tool authorization]
  A --> E[Execution monitor]
  E --> T[Stop or continue decision]
  T -->|new evidence| R[Observation and outcome]
  R --> U
  T -->|verified terminal result| Z[Terminal record]
